  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/tefilah">
          <tei:p>Hear our voice, Lord our God; spare us and have pity on us; accept our prayer in mercy and favor, for thou art God who hearest prayers and supplications; from thy presence, our King, dismiss us not empty-handed, for thou hearest in mercy the prayer of thy people Israel. Blessed art thou, O Lord, who hearest prayer.</tei:p>
